Description: lightweight viewer for STL 3D models
 Trigonum is a fast, lightweight viewer for STL files, the format used by
 3D printers and most CAD programs. It opens binary and ASCII files with
 millions of triangles, shows dimensions, volume and surface area, and
 reloads the model automatically when the file changes on disk.
 .
 It has a classic desktop interface with a menu bar, toolbar and status bar.
